      "2026-01-12 14:18:23,173 - INFO - System: 10 Cores, 24.0GB RAM -> 200 Partitions\n",
      "2026-01-12 14:18:24,700 - INFO - Spark Session erstellt: 8g Driver Memory, AQE aktiviert\n"
     ]
    },
    {
